{{!--
GET /register
This route will render a view with a sign-up form.
The form will contain 8 inputs and one select element (dropdown).

Required inputs / ids / names:
firstName
lastName
handle
password
confirmPassword
favoriteBook
pageBackground
textColor
membershipLevel
submitButton

The form will be used to submit the POST request to the /register route on the server and must have a name AND id attribute of "signup-form".
Do not forget to use labels for ALL inputs.
You will also have a link on this page that links to /signin and has the text "Already have an account? Click here to sign-in"
You should also have a link on this page to the home page.
An authenticated member should not ever see the sign-up screen!!!
--}}
